format-version: 1.2
ontology: hp-mini
remark: A hand-made hierarchy for the tests, NOT the ontology. The ids and names
remark: are the HPO's; the hierarchy is simplified (the terms in between are left
remark: out).

[Term]
id: HP:0000118
name: Phenotypic abnormality

[Term]
id: HP:0001626
name: Abnormality of the cardiovascular system
is_a: HP:0000118 ! Phenotypic abnormality

[Term]
id: HP:0001657
name: Prolonged QT interval
is_a: HP:0001626 ! Abnormality of the cardiovascular system

[Term]
id: HP:0000479
name: Abnormal retinal morphology
is_a: HP:0000118 ! Phenotypic abnormality
